<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Kafka Pulse: Resuming Messages & Offsets</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; background: #f4f7f6; color: #333; padding: 20px; max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; }
    h1, h2 { color: #2c3e50; }
    
    /* Concept Summary Block - Standard Simple Style */
    .summary { background: #e8f4f8; border-left: 5px solid #3498db; padding: 15px 20px; border-radius: 5px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
    .summary ul { margin: 10px 0 0 0; padding-left: 20px; }
    .summary li { margin-bottom: 8px; line-height: 1.5; font-size: 15px; }

    /* Interactive Instructions Panel */
    .instructions { background: #fff3cd; border: 2px solid #ffeeba; border-left: 5px solid #ffc107; padding: 15px 20px; border-radius: 5px; margin-bottom: 30px; }
    .instructions h3 { margin-top: 0; color: #856404; font-size: 16px; }
    .instructions ol { margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; color: #856404; font-weight: 500; }
    .instructions li { margin-bottom: 5px; }

    /* Layout Grids */
    .flex-center { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 20px; margin-bottom: 30px; }
    
    /* Box Styles */
    .box { background: white; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px; border: 2px solid #ccc; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); min-width: 300px; }
    .box h3 { margin-top: 0; text-align: center; background: #343a40; color: white; border-radius: 4px; padding-bottom: 10px; padding-top: 10px; font-size: 16px; }
    
    /* Consumer Group Container */
    .group-container { background: #e9ecef; border: 2px dashed #adb5bd; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 20px; text-align: center; }
    .group-title { font-weight: bold; color: #495057; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 18px; }

    /* Messages & Highlights */
    .msg { background: #f8f9fa; border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px; margin-bottom: 5px; border-radius: 4px; border-left: 4px solid #007bff; font-family: monospace; font-size: 14px; text-align: left; }
    .msg.highlight { background: #fff3cd; border-color: #ffeeba; border-left: 4px solid #ffc107; font-weight: bold; }
    
    /* UI Elements */
    .btn-group { display: flex; gap: 15px; margin-bottom: 30px; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    button { background: #28a745; color: white; border: none; padding: 10px 20px; font-size: 15px; border-radius: 5px; cursor: pointer; transition: 0.2s; font-weight: bold; }
    button:hover { background: #218838; }
    button:disabled { background: #bdc3c7; cursor: not-allowed; }
    
    .btn-danger { background: #dc3545; }
    .btn-danger:hover { background: #c82333; }
    .btn-info { background: #17a2b8; display: none; /* Hidden at start */ } 
    .btn-info:hover { background: #138496; }
    
    .assigned-label { text-align: center; color: #666; font-size: 13px; margin-top: -5px; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: bold; }
    .empty { text-align: center; color: #aaa; font-style: italic; font-size: 13px; }
    
    /* Offline State */
    .offline-box { background: #e9ecef; border-color: #adb5bd; opacity: 0.7; }
    .offline-box h3 { background: #6c757d; }
    .offline-text { color: #6c757d; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; margin-top: 20px; }

    /* Toast Popup for Offsets */
    .toast { position: fixed; bottom: 30px; right: 30px; background: #2c3e50; color: white; padding: 15px 25px; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.3); font-weight: bold; font-size: 15px; transform: translateY(100px); opacity: 0; transition: all 0.4s ease; z-index: 1000; border-left: 5px solid #17a2b8; }
    .toast.show { transform: translateY(0); opacity: 1; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <h1>Feature 5: Fault Tolerance - Resuming messages</h1>

  <div class="summary">
    <h2>Concept Summary</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Kafka assigns a sequential ID number called an <strong>Offset</strong> (bookmark) to every message in a partition.</li>
      <li><strong>Consumers have no identity.</strong> They are entirely disposable workers.</li>
      <li>Because workers are disposable, Offsets are strictly maintained per partition at the <strong>Consumer Group</strong> level.</li>
      <li><em>The Intuition:</em> Think of a team building a brick wall. If Worker A goes home sick, they don't take their progress notebook with them. The progress is marked on a <strong>Manager's Clipboard</strong> bolted to the wall. When a new Worker B arrives, they simply check the clipboard and seamlessly lay the next brick.</li>
      <li>This allows a new consumer to resume reading exactly where the crashed consumer left off, ensuring no data is ever lost.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="instructions">
    <h3>Interactive Demonstration Flow:</h3>
    <ol>
      <li>Click <strong>Produce Message</strong> exactly 2 times. Watch Consumer A process them.</li>
      <li>Click <strong>Disconnect Consumer A</strong> (simulating a server crash).</li>
      <li>Click <strong>Produce Message</strong> 4 more times. They will queue up safely in the Partition.</li>
      <li>Click <strong>Reconnect Consumer B</strong> (spinning up a new server). Watch it instantly pull messages 3 through 6!</li>
    </ol>
  </div>

  <div class="btn-group">
    <button id="produce-btn" onclick="produce()">Produce Message (0/6)</button>
    <button id="disconnect-btn" class="btn-danger" onclick="disconnectA()">Disconnect Consumer A</button>
    <button id="reconnect-btn" class="btn-info" onclick="reconnectB()">Reconnect Consumer B</button>
  </div>

  <h2>1. Kafka Topic (The Brokers)</h2>
  <div class="flex-center" id="partitions-view">
    <!-- Partitions injected here via JS -->
  </div>

  <h2>2. Consumer Group (The Workers)</h2>
  <div id="groups-view">
    <!-- Consumer Group injected here via JS -->
  </div>

  <!-- Hidden Toast Popup -->
  <div id="toast" class="toast"></div>

  <script>
    // Frontend UI state flags
    let isConsumerADisconnected = false;
    let isConsumerBConnected = false;

    // Toast Popup helper
    function showToast(message) {
      const toast = document.getElementById('toast');
      toast.innerText = message;
      toast.classList.add('show');
      
      // Auto hide after 3.5 seconds
      setTimeout(() => {
        toast.classList.remove('show');
      }, 3500);
    }

    async function produce() {
      await fetch('/resuming-messages/api/produce-message', { method: 'POST' });
      updateUI(); 
    }

    async function disconnectA() {
      await fetch('/resuming-messages/api/disconnect-consumerA', { method: 'POST' });
      
      isConsumerADisconnected = true;
      
      // Update UI buttons
      const btn = document.getElementById('disconnect-btn');
      btn.innerText = "Consumer A Offline";
      btn.disabled = true;
      btn.style.background = "#6c757d";
      
      // Reveal the Reconnect button
      document.getElementById('reconnect-btn').style.display = 'inline-block';
      
      updateUI();
    }

    async function reconnectB() {
      await fetch('/resuming-messages/api/connect-new-consumer', { method: 'POST' });
      
      isConsumerBConnected = true;
      
      // Trigger the explicit visual popup for the user
      showToast("🔄 Consumer B Connected! Pulling consumer group offsets for partition 0...");
      
      // Update UI button
      const btn = document.getElementById('reconnect-btn');
      btn.innerText = "Consumer B Connected";
      btn.disabled = true;
      
      updateUI();
    }

    async function updateUI() {
      const res = await fetch('/resuming-messages/api/fetch-state');
      const state = await res.json();

      // Enforce max 6 messages
      const totalProduced = state.taskCounter !== undefined 
        ? state.taskCounter 
        : (state.partitions[0] ? state.partitions[0].length : 0);

      const produceBtn = document.getElementById('produce-btn');
      if (totalProduced >= 6) {
        produceBtn.disabled = true;
        produceBtn.innerText = "Max Messages Reached (6/6)";
      } else {
        produceBtn.disabled = false;
        produceBtn.innerText = `Produce Message (${totalProduced}/6)`;
      }

      // 1. Draw the 1 Partition
      let pHTML = '';
      let msgsP0 = (state.partitions[0] || []).map(m => 
        `<div class="msg ${m === state.latestTask ? 'highlight' : ''}">${m}</div>`
      ).join('');
      
      pHTML += `<div class="box">
                  <h3>Partition 0</h3>
                  ${msgsP0 || '<p class="empty">Empty</p>'}
                </div>`;
      
      document.getElementById('partitions-view').innerHTML = pHTML;

      // 2. Draw the Consumer Group
      let consumersHTML = '';
      
      // Render Consumer A
      let dataA = state.consumers["Consumer A"] || { partition: "?", messages: [] };
      if (isConsumerADisconnected) {
        consumersHTML += `<div class="box offline-box">
                            <h3>Consumer A (OFFLINE)</h3>
                            <p class="offline-text">Disconnected from Group</p>
                          </div>`;
      } else {
        let msgsA = dataA.messages.map(m => 
          `<div class="msg ${m === state.latestTask ? 'highlight' : ''}">${m}</div>`
        ).join('');

        consumersHTML += `<div class="box" style="border: 2px solid #ccc;">
                            <h3 style="background: #17a2b8;">Consumer A</h3>
                            <p class="assigned-label">Assigned Partition: ${dataA.partition}</p>
                            ${msgsA || '<p class="empty">Waiting...</p>'}
                          </div>`;
      }

      // Render Consumer B (Only if reconnected)
      if (isConsumerBConnected) {
        let dataB = state.consumers["Consumer B"] || { partition: "?", messages: [] };
        let msgsB = dataB.messages.map(m => 
          `<div class="msg ${m === state.latestTask ? 'highlight' : ''}">${m}</div>`
        ).join('');

        consumersHTML += `<div class="box" style="border: 2px solid #ccc;">
                            <h3 style="background: #28a745;">Consumer B (New Worker)</h3>
                            <p class="assigned-label">Assigned Partition: ${dataB.partition}</p>
                            ${msgsB || '<p class="empty" style="color: #28a745; font-weight:bold;">Pulling group offsets...</p>'}
                          </div>`;
      }

      // Wrap the consumers in the dashed group container
      let gHTML = `<div class="group-container">
                    <h3 class="group-title">Consumer Group</h3>
                    <div class="flex-center" style="margin-bottom: 0;">
                      ${consumersHTML}
                    </div>
                  </div>`;

      document.getElementById('groups-view').innerHTML = gHTML;
    }

    // Refresh the UI every 2 seconds
    setInterval(updateUI, 2000);
    updateUI();
  </script>
</body>
</html>